      "text": "in dream, Lehi1 travels in darkness, 1 Ne. 8:4, 7–8. mist of darkness to cover land at Christ’s death, 1 Ne. 12:4–5 (19:11). Lamanites become dark and loathsome people, 1 Ne. 12:23 (Alma 3:6; Morm. 5:15). three days of darkness to be sign of Christ’s death, 1 Ne. 19:10 (Hel. 14:20, 27; 3 Ne. 8:3, 19–23; 10:9). commandment not to revile against Lamanites because of darkness of skins, Jacob 3:9. cloud of darkness overshadows prison of Nephi2 and Lehi4, Hel. 5:28–43. no darkness in night before Christ’s birth, Hel. 14:3–4 (3 Ne. 1:15, 19). more righteous part of people are not overpowered by vapor of darkness, 3 Ne. 10:12–13. the Lord causes stones to shine in darkness, Ether 6:3.",
